		"description": "Complete search component: the debounced term is the cache key, so each settled term is fetched once and cached, and short terms never fire. Requires @tanstack/vue-query, @vueuse/core and a request function of your own.\n\n完整的搜索组件：防抖后的词即缓存键，每个稳定下来的词只请求一次并被缓存，过短的词不会触发请求；需要 @tanstack/vue-query、@vueuse/core，以及自建的请求函数。",
